      "id": 312401920170,
      "body_html": "<p>Finding a body lotion without chemicals that actually works starts here. This collection is formulated for anyone who wants effective daily hydration without parabens, synthetic fragrances, phthalates, or artificial dyes—including those with sensitive, reactive, or pregnancy-sensitive skin.</p><p>What makes Real Skin Care different: we keep formulas intentionally simple. Plant-based ingredients like shea butter, coconut oil, and aloe vera do the work—no fillers, no masking agents, no unnecessary additives. Every formula is transparent about what's in it and why.</p><p>These lotions absorb cleanly, work well for full-body and hand hydration, and fit easily into minimalist skincare routines. Whether you're building a cleaner routine or shopping for the whole family, you'll find options here that are straightforward, gentle, and honest. Real ingredients. No harsh chemicals. Nothing your skin doesn't need.</p>"
